{"2314460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CultureHouse", "steam_appid": 2314460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to CultureHouse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314460/extras/82578bb6c00fa60231260c07e6828122.poster.avif?t=1786202421\" width=1170 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314460/extras/82578bb6c00fa60231260c07e6828122.webm?t=1786202421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314460/extras/82578bb6c00fa60231260c07e6828122.mp4?t=1786202421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is home to Dr. Ipse, a scientist who disappeared seven years ago — a residence he once shared with his family, doubled as a research facility. Within these walls, you conduct cultivation experiments on strange organisms known as Geneo.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World in Decline</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314460/extras/19347e1d0565aa09ca8028a59330be4a.poster.avif?t=1786202421\" width=1170 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314460/extras/19347e1d0565aa09ca8028a59330be4a.webm?t=1786202421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314460/extras/19347e1d0565aa09ca8028a59330be4a.mp4?t=1786202421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >War and a disease known as Cornea are driving civilization toward a slow collapse. The means to halt its progress may lie hidden within the cultivation experiments conducted at CultureHouse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Anomaly Subjects</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314460/extras/c82e3bb7abf420ba428da61acbaf56ff.poster.avif?t=1786202421\" width=1170 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314460/extras/c82e3bb7abf420ba428da61acbaf56ff.webm?t=1786202421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314460/extras/c82e3bb7abf420ba428da61acbaf56ff.mp4?t=1786202421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unexplainable phenomena, known as Anomaly Subjects, occur within CultureHouse and its surroundings. Photographing and recording them yields Boundary Crystals, a material essential to the cultivation process.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Geneo (Genesius Organismus)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314460/extras/63cc43f6c2da825e4ed8281098b940aa.poster.avif?t=1786202421\" width=1170 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314460/extras/63cc43f6c2da825e4ed8281098b940aa.webm?t=1786202421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314460/extras/63cc43f6c2da825e4ed8281098b940aa.mp4?t=1786202421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The organisms cultivated at CultureHouse, known as Geneo, take on different forms depending on the conditions in which they are raised. Some may pose a threat — to the world, or to you yourself. Overcome them, and the truth behind Dr. Ipse's experiments will begin to reveal itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now, let the experiment begin.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to CultureHouse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314460/extras/82578bb6c00fa60231260c07e6828122.poster.avif?t=1786202421\" width=1170 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314460/extras/82578bb6c00fa60231260c07e6828122.webm?t=1786202421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314460/extras/82578bb6c00fa60231260c07e6828122.mp4?t=1786202421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is home to Dr. Ipse, a scientist who disappeared seven years ago — a residence he once shared with his family, doubled as a research facility. Within these walls, you conduct cultivation experiments on strange organisms known as Geneo.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World in Decline</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314460/extras/19347e1d0565aa09ca8028a59330be4a.poster.avif?t=1786202421\" width=1170 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314460/extras/19347e1d0565aa09ca8028a59330be4a.webm?t=1786202421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314460/extras/19347e1d0565aa09ca8028a59330be4a.mp4?t=1786202421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >War and a disease known as Cornea are driving civilization toward a slow collapse. The means to halt its progress may lie hidden within the cultivation experiments conducted at CultureHouse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Anomaly Subjects</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314460/extras/c82e3bb7abf420ba428da61acbaf56ff.poster.avif?t=1786202421\" width=1170 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314460/extras/c82e3bb7abf420ba428da61acbaf56ff.webm?t=1786202421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314460/extras/c82e3bb7abf420ba428da61acbaf56ff.mp4?t=1786202421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unexplainable phenomena, known as Anomaly Subjects, occur within CultureHouse and its surroundings. Photographing and recording them yields Boundary Crystals, a material essential to the cultivation process.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Geneo (Genesius Organismus)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314460/extras/63cc43f6c2da825e4ed8281098b940aa.poster.avif?t=1786202421\" width=1170 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314460/extras/63cc43f6c2da825e4ed8281098b940aa.webm?t=1786202421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314460/extras/63cc43f6c2da825e4ed8281098b940aa.mp4?t=1786202421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The organisms cultivated at CultureHouse, known as Geneo, take on different forms depending on the conditions in which they are raised. Some may pose a threat — to the world, or to you yourself. Overcome them, and the truth behind Dr. Ipse's experiments will begin to reveal itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now, let the experiment begin.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>", "short_description": "Seven days to cultivate the end. CultureHouse is an adventure game where you live in a missing scientist's home-turned-lab, cultivating strange organisms called Geneo. Complete the experiment, and the truth behind the scientist's family — and a world in slow decline — will surface.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314460/e778059afaff7bd8cb15abcea172455cae4555e9/header.jpg?t=1786202421", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314460/f49f8c7cf282d2fe1f27830d4d20071d55e42a09/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786202421", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314460/f49f8c7cf282d2fe1f27830d4d20071d55e42a09/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786202421", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 | AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 | AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-12500H | AMD Ryzen 5 6600H<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</stron